#: src/ui/dash/settings/LanguageContent.tsx
#. @context: Warning in the multilingual dialog about stamping posts that have no language
msgid ""
"{count, plural, one {# existing post} other {# existing posts}} with no language yet will be marked "
"as {language}."
msgstr "{count, plural, other {其中 # 篇還沒有語言，會標記為「{language}」。}}"

#: src/routes/dash/settings.tsx
#. @context: Error when a content language that posts still use would be dropped
msgid ""
"{count, plural, one {# post is} other {# posts are}} still written in {language}. Change their "
"language, or keep the language."
msgstr "{count, plural, other {還有 # 篇{language}貼文。先修改它們的語言，或保留該語言。}}"

#: src/routes/dash/settings.tsx
#. @context: Refusal in the multilingual dialog when the list drops a language that posts still use
msgid ""
"{count, plural, one {# post is} other {# posts are}} written in {language}, which is not on this "
"list. Add it back, or change their language first."
msgstr "{count, plural, other {還有 # 篇{language}貼文，但列表裡沒有這個語言。把它加回列表，或先修改這些貼文的語言。}}"

#: src/ui/dash/settings/ConfigEditorContent.tsx
#. @context: Config Editor live search result count
msgid "{count} settings shown"
msgstr "{count} 個設定已顯示"

#: src/ui/dash/settings/LanguageContent.tsx
#. @context: Body of the dialog confirming removal of the last additional language
msgid ""
"{language} is the only other language on this site, so removing it turns multilingual content off. "
"The root address goes back to showing every language, {prefix} stops working, and each post keeps "
"the language it is written in."
msgstr "移除 {language} 後就只剩主語言了，多語言會一併關閉。根位址將恢復顯示所有語言，{prefix} 不再可用，每篇貼文的語言維持不變。"

#: src/ui/dash/settings/LanguageContent.tsx
#. @context: Body of the change-primary-language dialog
msgid ""
"{next} will be served at the root address (/, /feed, /archive), and {previous} moves to {prefix}. "
"Post addresses do not change, but anyone subscribed to /feed starts receiving {next} posts."
msgstr ""
"根位址（/、/feed、/archive）將改為提供「{next}」的內容，「{previous}」移至 {prefix}。貼文網址不會改變，但訂閱 /feed "
"的讀者從此收到的是「{next}」的貼文。"

